  <!-- EN: krath war mask -->
  <sw_Apparel_KrathWarMask.label>克拉斯战争面具</sw_Apparel_KrathWarMask.label>
  <!-- EN: An artistically terrifying war mask recreated in the style of the Krath. The Krath were a secret society from the Empress Teta system that was already famous for it's toxic carbonite mines and deadly war droids, both influences can be seen in the primitive aesthetic of this item.\n\n"The design similarity to a certain 'Space General' is purely coincidental". -->
  <sw_Apparel_KrathWarMask.description>以克拉斯人的风格再现的艺术性恐怖战争面具。克拉斯人是来自女皇泰塔星系的一个秘密组织，该组织因其有毒的碳石矿和致命的战争机器人而闻名于世，从这件物品的原始美学中可以看出这两种影响。

"与某位'太空将军'的设计相似纯属巧合"。</sw_Apparel_KrathWarMask.description>
